<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ParkNow - <%= title %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/twitter-bootstrap/4.6.1/css/bootstrap.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.2.0/css/all.min.css">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Days+One&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #004080, #002850, #111);
      background-position: center;
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      background-attachment: fixed;
      background-size: cover;
      color: #e9ecef;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .header {
      background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88);
      padding: 10px 0;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 1030;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 7px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }
    .logo {
      width: 170px;
      height: auto;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }
    .logo:hover {
      transform: scale(1.03);
    }
    .navbar {
      padding: 0.2rem 1rem;
    }
    .main {
      flex-grow: 1;
      padding: 50px 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .error-container {
      background-color: rgba(15, 30, 45, 0.9);
      padding: 40px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      max-width: 650px;
      width: 100%;
      margin: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .error-icon {
      font-size: 80px;
      color: #e74c3c;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-family: 'Days One', sans-serif;
      color: #e74c3c;
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background-color: #54C87D;
      border-color: #54C87D;
      padding: 12px 25px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-top: 30px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
      background-color: #43a065;
      border-color: #43a065;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(84, 200, 125, 0.4);
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
      color: #aaa;
      padding: 20px 0;
      text-align: center;
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: auto;
      box-shadow: 0 -2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="header">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="navbar navbar-dark">
        <a class="navbar-brand" href="/">
          <img src="/img/logo.png" alt="Logo ParkNow" class="logo">
        </a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="main">
    <div class="error-container">
      <i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle error-icon"></i>
      <h1><%= title %></h1>
      <p class="lead"><%= message %></p>
      <p>Se o problema persistir, entre em contato com a equipe de suporte do ParkNow.</p>
      <a href="/admin_home/admin-home.html" class="btn btn-primary">Ir para o Portal do Administrador</a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> ParkNow - Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.5.1.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/popper.js@1.16.1/dist/umd/popper.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/twitter-bootstrap/4.6.1/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
